                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While the experience is short, I am happy that I played this!  I found it rather unique and was struck emotionally.  Seeing death in VR is much more powerful than on flat screen.  Especially when you are the one helping with the killing.  Not to say that this is a violent game where you murder people!  You play as a reaper helping people move on. I'm happy that there are two endings.  Not much choice but the fact that there is at least one definitely helps.",
